cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "optcon: dimensional, contract-checked physical computation for optics"
abstract: >-
  optcon carries physical units and an amplitude order through everyday optical
  calculations, turns losslessness, passivity, reciprocity and derivative
  correctness into checkable contracts, and brings external optical solvers
  under the same type discipline so that independent implementations can be
  compared against each other.
authors:
